 US Market, Bringing Its AI Intelligence Platform to American Financial Institutions\",\"published_at\":\"2026-09-25\",\"excerpt\":\"Vaia, an AI-powered intelligence platform for financial institutions, has announced its expansion into the United States to serve banks, investment firms, wealth managers and family offices\",\"retrieved_at\":\"2026-10-02T05:06:08+00:00\",\"page_fetched\":false}]', '[\"Vaia is an AI-powered intelligence platform for financial institutions.\",\"It announced expansion into the United States to serve banks, investment firms, wealth managers and family offices.\",\"The company is Bengaluru-born and is building a deeper US presence.\",\"It reports an internal valuation approaching high double-digits fueled by investor interest.\"]', '[\"Whether Vaia is seeking external AI vendors or partners.\",\"Budget, procurement process and decision-makers.\",\"Whether any specific project or requirement exists.\"]', '2026-09-25', '2026-09-25', 'ec7e993f011cc9ebda75d9983bf13f2576b891d8f1b7dbe78ae7c1e6d02feb81', '2026-10-02 05:07:11', '2026-10-02 05:07:11', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-02 05:07:11', '2026-10-02 05:07:11');
